{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104047","id":2388974457,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OZNt5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104047.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104047","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104047/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104047/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104047/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bebe037abfe1cd7957dea1a19b6d764f3010e856","number":104047,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add const iteration support to `Dictionary`","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Based on the assumption in #103999, we are able to bring `ConstIterator` to `Dictionary` without breaking the `read_only` property. Since the inner `HashMap` already has a nice iterator implementation, I just export it with alias to keep the change minimal.\r\n\r\nMain usecase of this is to replace `Dictionary::get_key_list()`. Previously if we want to iterate a `Dictionary` we have to write:\r\n```C++\r\nList<Variant> keys;\r\ndict.get_key_list(&keys);\r\nfor (const Variant &key : keys) {\r\n    const Variant &value = dict[key];\r\n    ......\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis pattern includes unnecessary heap allocation (the `List`), redundant iteration (populate keys in `get_key_list()`) and an extra hashmap lookup (if you need both key and value).\r\n\r\nWith `ConstIterator` we can now write:\r\n```C++\r\nfor (const KeyValue<Variant, Variant> &kv : dict) {\r\n    const Variant &key = kv.key;\r\n    const Variant &value = kv.value;\r\n    ......\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNo heap allocation, scan exactly one time and no hashmap lookup.\r\n\r\nI measure performance diff between the two pattern with [MRP from #100333](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100333#issuecomment-2583278772) (Note this workload is constructed intentionally to be bottlenecked at `Dictionary` iteration, `Dictionary` stringify would be a better showcase but unfortunately it is now bottlenecked by `String` concat)\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n```bash\r\n729 ms\r\n732 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n727 ms\r\n729 ms\r\n725 ms\r\n725 ms\r\n720 ms\r\n714 ms\r\naverage: 725 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n```bash\r\n271 ms\r\n270 ms\r\n273 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n272 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n273 ms\r\n271 ms\r\n272 ms\r\naverage: 271 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nCallers who sort the key list or modify values in the loop are kept untouched.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-12T18:54:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:25Z","cl